{"id": "189159", "name": "מציאת הטלה על ישר", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "innerproduct", "params": ["x", "y"], "body": "block([listarith],listarith:true,ratsimp(conjugate(x).y))"}, {"name": "norm", "params": ["x"], "body": "sqrt(innerproduct(x,x))"}, {"name": "gramschmidt_mat_cols", "params": ["x"], "body": "transpose(apply(matrix,gramschmidt(makelist(list_matrix_entries(row(transpose(x), i)), i, 1, length(transpose(x))))))"}, {"name": "gen_rand_3_mat", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]))"}, {"name": "get_rand_orth_basis", "params": ["n"], "body": "gramschmidt_mat_cols(gen_rand_3_mat(n))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון הישר הבא ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ L = Span \\{ {{CT:0}} \\} \\]</p><p>והוקטור:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ v = {{CT:1}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו את ההטלה של v על הישר:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\"